  "content": "\n\n---\n<p align=\"center\"?>\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/datapack/iron-nugget-recycling\">\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/bf84aa11b4afd69cdbd20a199bc6d93c50fac58b.png\" \n        alt=\"Modrinth\" \n        width=\"64\"  \n        url=\"modrinth.com\"\n        style=\"display: block; margin: 0 auto\" /></a>\n<a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/data-packs/iron-nugget-recycling\">\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/3531508338997863e0b15c2252d16bf51ceb5669.png\" \n        alt=\"Curseforge\" \n        width=\"64\"  \n        style=\"display: block; margin: 0 auto\" /></a>\n<a href=\"https://www.planetminecraft.com/data-pack/iron-nugget-recycling\">\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/eac8caa46edda35d821be9a2e1a8e16a00a9cadc.png\" \n        alt=\"Planet Minecraft\" \n        width=\"64\"  \n        style=\"display: block; margin: 0 auto\" /></a>\n</p>  \n\n---\n**鐵粒回收** 讓你能將大多數需要鐵的道具熔煉成鐵粒。在探索包含鐵欄杆或鐵軌等方塊的結構時，這將特別實用。當你製作太多鐵門等物品時，也可以用它來回收一些鐵資源。\n\n**想要黃金粒？請查看 [黃金粒回收](https://modrinth.com/datapack/gold-nugget-recycling)！**\n\n---\n\n<details>\n<summary>現在可熔煉成鐵粒的物品列表</summary>\n \n- 桶\n- 剪刀\n- 打火石\n- 弩\n- 盾牌\n- 指南針\n- 復原指南針\n- 礦車\n- 儲物礦車\n- 漏斗礦車\n- 漏斗\n- 煉藥鍋\n- 鐵砧（所有變體）\n- 鍛造臺\n- 鎖鏈\n- 燈籠與靈魂燈籠\n- 懸掛告示牌（所有變體）\n- 鐵門\n- 鐵閘門\n- 鐵軌\n- 探測鐵軌\n- 激活鐵軌\n- 鐵欄杆\n- 偵測線鉤\n- 重型重量壓板\n- 馬鞍\n\n</details>\n\n![現在可熔煉成鐵粒的物品](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/fbc67d71699c363fd820bd71e03e5361a0e733b2.png)\n\n---",
